-08 21:13:58","kind":"checkpoint","frames":5001216,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_005001k.pt","score":11.0,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 21:06:56","kind":"checkpoint","frames":4501504,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_004501k.pt","score":22.0,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 21:00:08","kind":"checkpoint","frames":4001792,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_004001k.pt","score":20.0,"champion":"checkpoints/main/model_004001k.pt","run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0010.gif"},{"kind":"goal_check","t":"2026-11-08 20:57:23","policy":"checkpoints/main/model_002502k.pt","frames":2502656,"n":10,"score":5.4,"std":2.4585451886114367,"ci":[3.6413849085146577,7.158615091485343],"min":1.0,"max":9.0,"scores":[4.0,8.0,4.0,7.0,7.0,6.0,1.0,3.0,5.0,9.0],"lengths":[277,336,282,385,398,335,176,263,316,488],"truncated":[false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false],"seed":12345,"greedy":false,"label":"after 2.5 M frames \u00b7 full game","note":"checkpoint check, seeds 12345-12354","seconds":7.5,"protocol":"full","replay":"replays/goal_goal_f002502k.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:53:34","kind":"checkpoint","frames":3502080,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_003502k.pt","score":15.0,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:47:07","kind":"checkpoint","frames":3002368,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_003002k.pt","score":7.5,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:39:41","kind":"checkpoint","frames":2502656,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_002502k.pt","score":9.0,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:33:14","kind":"checkpoint","frames":2002944,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_002002k.pt","score":4.0,"champion":"checkpoints/main/model_002002k.pt","run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0006.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:24:45","title":"Change 1: 10 M -> 40 M frames (CleanRL's '10M' means 10 M agent steps)","text":"At 1.4 M frames the training score was flat at about 2 per game. Checking the plan against the sources found the problem: CleanRL's total_timesteps=10M counts agent steps, and with frame skip 4 that is 40 M frames, the same budget as the PPO paper (which reports 274.8 on Breakout at 40 M frames). The plan said 10 M frames, a quarter of that, with the learning rate annealed to 0 by then; at that budget CleanRL's own curves are around 100-150, far from 300. So the run was stopped at its 1.5 M checkpoint and resumed with --total-frames 40000000: same run, same MLflow run (the change is a tag there), and the linear learning-rate schedule now runs to 40 M (at 1.5 M frames the rate went from 2.16e-4 to 2.40e-4). At about 330 agent steps/s, 40 M frames take about 8 more hours, inside the 20-hour budget. Nothing else changed.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:24:07","kind":"resume","iteration":367,"frames":1503232,"run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:24:07","kind":"override","what":"total frames 10 M -> 40 M","reason":"total_frames changed from 10000000 to 40000000 at 1503232 frames; the linear learning-rate schedule now runs to the new total","run":"main"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:23:49","kind":"checkpoint","frames":1503232,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_001503k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/main/model_001503k.pt","score":2.2,"run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0003.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:16:44","kind":"checkpoint","frames":1003520,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_001003k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/main/model_001003k.pt","score":2.33,"run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0002.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:09:42","kind":"checkpoint","frames":503808,"path":"checkpoints/main/model_000503k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/main/model_000503k.pt","score":1.25,"run":"main","replay":"replays/main_0001.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:00:58","title":"Smoke test passed (10 minutes, with a crash-resume in the middle)","text":"Two 5-minute halves: the second resumed from checkpoints/smoke/latest.pt at iteration 83 (340k frames) and continued to 655k frames. Checkpoints every 100k frames, MLflow metrics and the site files all written. Training score after 655k frames: about 2 per game, as expected this early (random play scores about 1.4).","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:00:58","title":"Main run started: CleanRL settings, 10 M frames","text":"Seed 1, 8 envs x 128 steps, 4 epochs x 4 minibatches of 256, clip 0.1, lr 2.5e-4 annealed linearly to 0, entropy 0.01, value coef 0.5, GAE lambda 0.95, gamma 0.99, grad norm 0.5. Episodic life and reward clipping for training only. Checkpoints every 500k frames; supervise.sh restarts from the last one after a crash.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:00:57","title":"Measured first: envpool, 4 PyTorch threads","text":"envpool runs Breakout at about 4,000 agent steps/s with random actions (8-32 games), gymnasium's AsyncVectorEnv at 1,700-1,900, so envpool it is. The full PPO loop (8 games x 128 steps, 4 epochs x 4 minibatches, Nature CNN on CPU) runs at about 288 agent steps/s with 4 PyTorch threads, the same as with 6 and faster than with 8 (225: the CPU has 4 physical cores). 10 M frames = 2.5 M agent steps = about 2.4 hours, well inside the 12-hour budget, so no compiled port (ml-speedup) is needed. The update is 3/4 of the time.","kind":"journal"},{"t":"2026-11-08 20:00:52","kind":"run_start","run":"main","mlflow_run_id":"518e9b88a1c849368984b2f7c7927b35"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:59:14","kind":"checkpoint","frames":602112,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000602k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000602k.pt","score":2.2,"note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke","replay":"replays/smoke_0007.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:57:53","kind":"checkpoint","frames":503808,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000503k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000503k.pt","score":2.5,"note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke","replay":"replays/smoke_0006.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:56:25","kind":"checkpoint","frames":401408,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000401k.pt","champion":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000401k.pt","score":2.0,"note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke","replay":"replays/smoke_0005.gif"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:55:34","kind":"resume","iteration":83,"frames":339968,"run":"smoke"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:54:52","kind":"checkpoint","frames":303104,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000303k.pt","note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:53:24","kind":"checkpoint","frames":200704,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000200k.pt","note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:51:53","kind":"checkpoint","frames":102400,"path":"checkpoints/smoke/model_000102k.pt","note":"smoke test checkpoint","run":"smoke"},{"t":"2026-11-08 19:50:28","kind":"run_start","run":"smoke","mlflow_run_id":"85d28fc8528d468da524d3b3715d3e75"}]